---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const sonnets = [
  { slug: 'sonnet2',  label: 'Sonnet 2',  subtitle: 'When forty winters shall besiege thy brow' },
  { slug: 'sonnet29', label: 'Sonnet 29', subtitle: 'When, in disgrace with Fortune and men\'s eyes' },
];
---

<Layout title="Shakespeare Echo Visualizer">

<h1>Shakespeare Echo Visualizer</h1>

<p>
  Shakespeare's sonnets are dense with internal echoes — words that rhyme, repeat,
  or share roots in ways that create a web of meaning beneath the surface.
  Stephen Booth, in his landmark commentary on the sonnets, catalogues hundreds of
  these connections: phonetic links where sounds mirror each other across lines,
  semantic links where a word quietly calls back to an earlier one, and cases where
  the two are inseparable.
</p>
<p>
  This visualizer makes those links visible. As each word is spoken, you'll see
  ripples reach back to the words it resonates with. You can also hover over any
  word to explore its connections directly.
</p>

<h2>Key</h2>

<ul class="key-list">
  <li class="key-item">
    <span class="key-swatch" style="background: rgb(120,152,255)"></span>
    <strong>Phonetic</strong> — shared sounds (rhyme, alliteration, assonance)
  </li>
  <li class="key-item">
    <span class="key-swatch" style="background: rgb(255,190,80)"></span>
    <strong>Semantic</strong> — shared meaning (synonyms, antonyms, word fields)
  </li>
  <li class="key-item">
    <span class="key-swatch" style="background: rgb(140,220,160)"></span>
    <strong>Both</strong> — same word repeated, or inseparable sound and sense
  </li>
  <li class="key-item">
    <strong style="color: rgb(255,140,60)">!</strong> — surprising usage (e.g. a noun used as a verb)
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>Sonnets</h2>

<ul class="sonnet-list">
  {sonnets.map(s => (
    <li>
      <a href={`/languages/english/shakespeare/${s.slug}`}>
        {s.label} — <em>{s.subtitle}</em>
      </a>
    </li>
  ))}
</ul>

</Layout>

<style>
  .key-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .key-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .key-swatch {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sonnet-list {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sonnet-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
</style>
